{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EdmoM4yXzQpvFiWM28Bc9F","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Baseline Measurements\n2\t\n3\tDate: 2026-04-12\n4\tBranch: v2-powdr-07-04 (commit 2123b6a7)\n5\tGPU: NVIDIA RTX 4090\n6\t\n7\t## STARK (excl. trace) — Target Metric\n8\t\n9\t| Config | STARK excl trace | Constraints | LogUp GKR | Round 0 | MLE Rounds | Openings | WHIR | Stacked Red. | Trace Commit |\n10\t|--------|-----------------|-------------|-----------|---------|------------|----------|------|-------------|-------------|\n11\t| APC 0  | 2153 ms         | 1292 ms     | 993 ms    | 178 ms  | 118 ms     | 336 ms   | 220 ms | 113 ms    | 518 ms      |\n12\t| APC 100| 2155 ms         | 1393 ms     | 775 ms    | 464 ms  | 150 ms     | 342 ms   | 138 ms | 202 ms    | 418 ms      |\n13\t| APC 300| 2455 ms         | 1634 ms     | 790 ms    | 662 ms  | 180 ms     | 413 ms   | 100 ms | 311 ms    | 406 ms      |\n14\t\n15\t## Workload Scaling (APC 0 → APC 300)\n16\t\n17\t| Metric                    | APC 0       | APC 300     | Ratio  |\n18\t|--------------------------|-------------|-------------|--------|\n19\t| Cells                    | 1,904M      | 811M        | 2.35x  |\n20\t| Constraint Instances     | 1,126M      | 505M        | 2.23x  |\n21\t| Bus Interaction Messages | 965M        | 448M        | 2.16x  |\n22\t| AIR Instances            | 99          | 623         | 0.16x (6.3x MORE) |\n23\t| Columns                  | 3,919       | 106,842     | 0.04x (27x MORE) |\n24\t| STARK (excl. trace)      | 2153 ms     | 2455 ms     | 0.88x (14% WORSE) |\n25\t\n26\t## Key Observation\n27\t\n28\tDespite >2x reduction in cells/constraints/messages, STARK time INCREASES by 14%.\n29\tThe main culprits: Round 0 (+3.7x), Stacked Reduction (+2.75x), MLE Rounds (+53%).\n30\tLogUp GKR and Trace Commit do improve somewhat, but are offset by the regressions.\n31\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"082795c8-8731-491f-857a-d4da84233f33","uu