{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_013yq7T7QtjdfyUG4dHqFCL1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MbcQVwGdEJH1yQYCqH58j9","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nBatch stacked reduction MLE sync: eliminate per-window GPU pipeline drains\n\nReplace per-window D2H synchronization in batch_sumcheck_poly_eval() with\na single fill_zero + to_host per MLE round. Both CUDA kernels already use\natomic accumulation into d_accum, so per-window syncs were unnecessary.\n\nChanges:\n- Accept raw *const EF in degenerate kernel wrapper (pointer offset into\n  bulk-uploaded eq_ub buffer)\n- Allocate d_eq_ub_all for full unstacked_cols instead of per-window d_eq_ub\n- Upload eq_ub_per_trace once per round, fill_zero once, to_host once\n- Remove per-window reallocation and collection/sum of s_evals_batch\n\nAt APC 300: Stacked Reduction MLE rounds 280ms -> 95ms (2.95x),\nStacked Reduction total 312ms -> 126ms (2.48x),\nSTARK excl trace 2460ms -> 2268ms (1.08x lower).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\"","description":"Commit optimization changes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":122,"cache_read_input_tokens":76385,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":122},"output_tokens":57,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"082795c8-8731-491f-857a-d4da84233f33","uuid":"2fefce9b-32fe-429e-8063-1ee9150f0c9d"}
