mit:\nb406a555 Batch stacked reduction MLE sync: eliminate per-window GPU pipeline drains\n\n7. Tag:\nautoopt/2026-04-10-1933-defer-round0-d2h-sync\nautoopt/2026-04-10-2049-batch-round0-coset-parallel\nautoopt/2026-04-10-2145-batch-degenerate-stacked-reduction\nautoopt/2026-04-11-0945-precompute-round0-logup-rules\nautoopt/2026-04-12-2130-pipeline-round0-kernel-launches\nautoopt/2026-04-12-2245-parallelize-round0-cpu-postprocess\nautoopt/2026-04-12-2330-batch-stacked-reduction-mle-sync","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"082795c8-8731-491f-857a-d4da84233f33","uuid":"6d082f9e-bc78-4c0c-be5b-7fa90deccf37","timestamp":"2026-04-12T22:09:55.879Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"=== Verification Checklist ===\n\n1. Before measurements:\n/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-12-2330-batch-stacked-reduction-mle-sync/results/before_apc000.json\n/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-12-2330-batch-stacked-reduction-mle-sync/results/before_apc100.json\n/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-12-2330-batch-stacked-reduction-mle-sync/results/before_apc300.json\n\n2. After measurements:\n/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-12-2330-batch-stacked-reduction-mle-sync/results/after_apc000.json\n/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-12-2330-batch-stacked-reduction-mle-sync/results/after_apc100.json\n/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-12-2330-batch-stacked-reduction-mle-sync/results/after_apc300.json\n\n3. Report exists:\n/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-12-2330-batch-stacked-reduction-mle-sync/report.md\n\n4. Log entry:\n\n## 2026-04-12-2330-batch-stacked-reduction-mle-sync\n\n**Idea**: Eliminate per-window GPU synchronization in stacked reduction MLE rounds by batching all kernel launches with a single fill_zero + to_host per round.\n\n**Result**: success — Stacked Reduction at APC 300: 311ms → 126ms (2.47x lower vs baseline). STARK excl trace at APC 300: 2455ms → 2268ms (1